    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the moon, sniff some things. Unravel the plot of a villainous squirrel to sabotage the history of human invention.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doggins is a tiny snack of an adventure game, playable in a single sitting or enjoyed more slowly. The game features a fresh take on classic item-based puzzles, along with immersive visual storytelling and handcrafted animation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by married duo Brain&amp;Brain and inspired by their own indomitable cairn terrier, Doggins was first released in 2014 and now makes its debut on desktop with this 10th anniversary release.</p>",
